\caption{Total decay width of $Z^\prime$ (left panel) and its branching ratios into single-generation fermions (right panel) as a function of $x_H$ for $M_{Z^\prime}=7.5$ TeV and $x_\Phi=1$. We normalize the total decay width by ${g^\prime}^2$.}
