We notice that the quantity $s|q^{\rm{XY}}|$ becomes independent of $\sqrt{s}$
when $\sqrt{s} \gg M_{Z^\prime}$ and leading to almost flat curves mimicking the nature of an effective theory for large $s$. 
It happens due to face that both $\frac{m_{V_i}^2}{s}\ll 1$ and $\frac{m_{V_i} \Gamma_{V_i}}{s} \ll 1$ in this limit.


